  "story": {
    "day": 73,
    "title": "Kaya's Bali Dream",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya felt a small headache after school that day.",
      "She didn't want to study much for her next subject.",
      "But her social studies class was interesting.",
      "They learned about Indonesia, a big island nation.",
      "Kaya especially liked pictures of Bali.",
      "She saw a deep lake near a high mountain.",
      "She read how a leopard lives there with other animals.",
      "Kaya wondered how many kilometers or meters the river flowed.",
      "She wanted to spend a day there, from noon to night.",
      "She would listen to nature's sounds until the end.",
      "Later, her telephone rang with a text: \"I'd love to practice table tennis together!\"",
      "Kaya would send her reply after cooking soup in the kitchen and her shower."
    ]
  }
